<title>HONG KONG: S&amp;P adjusts ratings of HK firms after HK upgrade. [CORRECTED 10:12 GMT]</title>
<headline>S&amp;P adjusts ratings of HK firms after HK upgrade. [CORRECTED 10:12 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Wednesday it had raised the ratings and outlooks of several Hong Kong-based corporations following its upgrade of the territory's ratings.</p>
<p>S&amp;P raised Hong Kong's long-term foreign currency rating to A-plus/A-1-plus from single-A/A-1. It also raised Hong Kong's local currency rating to AA-minus/A-1-plus from A-plus/A-1.</p>
<p>The ratings actions on the corporations are as follows:</p>
<p>						   To	  From</p>
<p>China Light and Power Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Long-term foreign currency	   A+	  A</p>
<p>    Short-term foreign currency	  A-1	 A-1</p>
<p>    Long-term local currency	     A+	  A+</p>
<p>    Short-term local currency	    A-1	 A-1</p>
<p>    Outlook				    Stable    Positive</p>
<p>Hutchison Whampoa Ltd</p>
<p>    Long-term foreign currency	   A+	  A</p>
<p>    Short-term foreign currency	  A-1	 A-1</p>
<p>    Long-term local currency	     A+	  A+</p>
<p>    Short-term local currency	    A-1	 A-1</p>
<p>    Outlook				    Stable    Positive</p>
<p>Mass Transit Railway Corp</p>
<p>    Long-term foreign currency	   A+	  A</p>
<p>    Short-term foreign currency	  A-1+	A-1</p>
<p>    Long-term local currency	     AA-	 A+</p>
<p>    Short-term local currency	    A-1+	A-1</p>
<p>    Outlook				    Stable    Positive</p>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Long-term foreign currency	   A+	  A</p>
<p>    Short-term foreign currency	  A-1	 A-1</p>
<p>    Long-term local currency	     A+	  A+</p>
<p>    Short-term local currency	    A-1	 A-1</p>
<p>    Outlook				    Stable    Positive</p>
<p>    SHK Prop Finance Cayman Ltd (guar) A+	  A</p>
<p>    SHK Prop Int'l Treasury Ltd (guar) A+	  A</p>
<p>(Corrects ratings for Sun Hung Kai Properties)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
